%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dataweave-formats-text (言語ガイド)
doc と相違 (表記のみ: 引用符・括弧・書式の違いで、値は同じ)
doc の Output:
  "This is text plain"
%%% script
%dw 2.0
output application/dw
---
payload
%%% input payload text/plain
This is text plain
%%% output application/dw
"This is text plain" as String {encoding: "UTF-8", mediaType: "text/plain"}
